                                <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-md-center gap-3">
                                    <div>
                                        <h5 class="mb-1"><i class="fas fa-book-open me-2 text-primary"></i>Sandbox Documentation</h5>
                                        <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Jump to the live Sandbox examples and full Tag Helper reference.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
                                        <a href="/Sandbox" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">Open Sandbox</a>
                                        <a href="/Sandbox/TagHelpers" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Tag Helper Docs</a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                                                        <div class="card mb-4">
                                                                <div class="card-header">
                                                                        <h5 class="mb-0"><i class="fas fa-swatchbook me-2"></i>Theme System Implementation</h5>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="card-body">
                                                                        <p class="mb-3">The navbar palette dropdown applies live theme colors by setting CSS variables on <code>:root</code>. The tone toggle switches between light and dark surface styles without changing the selected palette identity.</p>

                                                                        <h6>How It Works</h6>
                                                                        <ul>
                                                                                <li><strong>Palette source:</strong> <code>GET /Sandbox/Palettes</code> returns JSON records with <code>id</code>, <code>name</code>, <code>colors</code>, and <code>sourceUrl</code>.</li>
                                                                                <li><strong>Palette UI:</strong> Search input filters available palettes; selecting one maps color tokens to CSS variables.</li>
                                                                                <li><strong>Tone mode:</strong> Light/Dark toggle adds or removes <code>theme-dark</code> on <code>body</code>.</li>
                                                                                <li><strong>Persistence:</strong> Selected palette and tone are saved in <code>localStorage</code> and restored on load.</li>
                                                                        </ul>

                                                                        <h6 class="mt-3">Server Contract</h6>
                                                                        <pre><code class="language-javascript">[
    {
        "id": "264653-2a9d8f-e9c46a-f4a261-e76f51",
        "name": "Coolors Terra",
        "colors": ["#264653", "#2A9D8F", "#E9C46A", "#F4A261", "#E76F51"],
        "sourceUrl": "https://coolors.co/palette/264653-2a9d8f-e9c46a-f4a261-e76f51"
    }
]</code></pre>

                                                                        <h6 class="mt-3">CSS Variable Mapping</h6>
                                                                        <pre><code class="language-css">:root {
    --theme-primary: #0d6efd;
    --theme-secondary: #0b5ed7;
    --theme-accent: #6ea8fe;
    --theme-surface: #f8f9fa;
    --theme-text-on-primary: #ffffff;
}

.navbar.bg-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--theme-primary), var(--theme-secondary));
}</code></pre>

                                                                        <h6 class="mt-3">Client Integration Pattern</h6>
                                                                        <pre><code class="language-javascript">const palettes = await fetch('/Sandbox/Palettes').then(r => r.json());

function applyPalette(palette) {
    document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--theme-primary', palette.colors[0]);
    document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--theme-secondary', palette.colors[1] ?? palette.colors[0]);
    document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--theme-accent', palette.colors[2] ?? palette.colors[0]);
    localStorage.setItem('selectedThemePalette', palette.id);
}

function applyTone(mode) {
    document.body.classList.toggle('theme-dark', mode === 'dark');
    localStorage.setItem('toneMode', mode);
}</code></pre>

                                                                        <h6 class="mt-3">Implementation Checklist</h6>
                                                                        <ol class="mb-0">
                                                                                <li>Add palette + tone controls to your shared navbar layout.</li>
                                                                                <li>Expose palette JSON endpoint from MVC controller.</li>
                                                                                <li>Define theme CSS variables and consume them in key UI components.</li>
                                                                                <li>Initialize picker and toggle logic on <code>DOMContentLoaded</code>.</li>
                                                                                <li>Persist selected palette and tone in <code>localStorage</code>.</li>
                                                                        </ol>
